BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Route One/USA (1989)
DTSTART:20261122T203000Z
DTEND:20261123T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261122T203000Z
UID:1nBEutAZS5
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 254 mins (4h14m)\n\nTraveling down the entirety of R
 oute 1 from Maine to Florida\, renegade filmmaker Robert Kramer and his fr
 iend Doc survey the state of ‘80s America in this monumental portrait of
  everyday Americans.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-open-
 road/route-one/usa\n\nEstimated start: 12:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
