BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Backcourt Documentary - Basketball's Best Kept Secret
DTSTART:20261129T233000Z
DTEND:20261130T014500Z
DTSTAMP:20261129T233000Z
UID:MEYokLjcnK
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nPresented by Teach One Publishi
 ng (Marquez Price and Obsidian Lens Media) and Damian Becerra (film produc
 er). Based on the Amazon bestseller "The Backcourt\," this documentary e
 xplores Tucson basketball legends Delano Price and Hoegie Simmons\, Southw
 est playground folklore\, while examining the Great Migration\, crack epid
 emic\, gang culture\, media propaganda\, prison-industrial complex\, broth
 erhood\, basketball\, triumph\, and adversity.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cin
 ema/in-theaters/the-backcourt-documentary-basketballs-best-kept-secret\n\n
 Estimated start: 15:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beware! The Devil’s Wrath
DTSTART:20261125T040000Z
DTEND:20261125T055000Z
DTSTAMP:20261125T040000Z
UID:Cs3d3My3LQ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nPresented by Alsatian Allied. B
 eware! The Devil’s Wrath is an occult revenge horror film set in the fic
 tional Texas town of Blackwood Falls. When a young couple moves into the t
 ight-knit community\, a shocking act of violence triggers a wave of ritual
 istic killings that forces residents to confront the dark secrets beneath 
 their pious exterior.Written and directed by Craig Meinhart\, this low-bud
 get feature draws inspiration from 1970s classics like Race with the Devil
 \, Last House on the Left\, and Don’t Look Now\, blending atmospheric dr
 ead\, practical effects\, and a hard-edged sense of vengeance.This special
  screening will be followed by a Q&A with the filmmaker.\n\nhttps://www.si
 ff.net/cinema/in-theaters/beware-the-devils-wrath-special-screening-qanda
 \n\nEstimated start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
