BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Musical
DTSTART:20261203T030000Z
DTEND:20261203T044000Z
DTSTAMP:20261203T030000Z
UID:R1CbrvV5yO
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 84 mins (1h24m)\n\nWhen a frustrated playwright/midd
 le school theater teacher finds out his ex-girlfriend has started dating h
 is nemesis\, the school’s principal\, he exacts revenge the only way he 
 knows how: by staging the most inappropriate play imaginable.Alumni of the
  2019 edition of NFFTY\, filmmaker Giselle Bonilla will be in conversation
  with NFFTY Program Manager Amy Williams following the film. Special youth
  pricing (24 & younger) is available.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-th
 eaters/the-musical-w/-director-qanda\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jawbreaker: A Film About Anti Cimex
DTSTART:20261214T031500Z
DTEND:20261214T055500Z
DTSTAMP:20261214T031500Z
UID:Zuls6bhO6r
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 145 mins (2h25m)\n\nPresented by Exploited Partisan
 s. Jawbreaker depicts Anti Cimex – the band that shaped Scandinavian ha
 rdcore punk and became one of Sweden's most influential musical exports.T
 hrough archive material\, international perspectives\, and a dreamy\, hum
 orous tone\, directors Tomas Haglund and Oskar Sjödin paint a portrait o
 f a musical legacy that still packs a punch.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinem
 a/in-theaters/jawbreaker-a-film-about-anti-cimex\n\nEstimated start: 19:30
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
